    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67284" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ ἀλλά</span></b> , an elliptic phrase for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ γένοιτο, ἀλλά</span> . . , or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ λέγε τοῦτο, ἀλλά</span> . . : only used in
